<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan launched air strikes in Syria after a church shooting, while Damascus and Amman gave contradictory accounts of the attack that killed civilians. Flash floods across Syria killed five people, including children, and injured several others. A Syrian hacker was sentenced to 42 months for attacks on Western media and the U.S. government, and Iraqi prime minister visited Syria amid security challenges in the north and south. 2,732 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxObmNNNmZnOTYyOWlEVUQyRVJya3doNDh1eVFVR0NMbWZEWllaS2p4bU9NeGFaZ1VHOURsRFhScTVRYjZnVXJuZmNPTzJyNU43YlRrTWQ0cU9ldXQ1VGVadDhQbG5mcTZnX3JlZEFtWm9kbFZxVUNyQUVwQUZXRGd0bGJMNGtuQ0c1cnhiNzJ0RWloNGRJajZEZjN3al8zZDFINHJHeldUTWJOVUc2Qk1PVUVKU0hLNFBqYU83cEVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTEFVX3lxTFB5RU51MGJleFJ2RTlIMnlqUTVrS05pTldNcG1NZzRFU2ZTLUU0N3VQRmUxbEliWDc4blgxbkExN2dxb0drX3MwVFMyTU4?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBfdmtSb2JwbjU4R3JBSU5VRUZzeE5nX2NBQmFrUnAwVVpsUF9lYWV1S1drRzFqM1NUY3NFdURZUDVETzVPV0xyaQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOSjltRzVfcTZCajZXemFtZzRndG9BM2tpZ0Y2UnhaeENKZXp6WGQxRERjeThUTUtxRDR6TE1IZlozSGFHRDlJNmZNNi1tVjhoU3g5VG4zQlFvc3R3OERRbGZFU3VPN2dXSHRldERvTVh4LWZDZERVdW9tdlYwNnVWd3ZibkIwdjZMcGFBcXIwR21VX2I0b3RhSU1aUUJfZEZtbDVjWUhZZUNzM0ho?oc=5&quot;&gt;FDD's Long War Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxOUGF5MzEweVl3U2lveTRjQl9MUkRsenZUQmlOTTFZNGpnTDBZcG9tVGlyRTVJRkxmNTF3dFBab3NjU3JfYVRlNjBKOTNENmM4SEstT3N5Z3JyRHd5X3kyOGZoT3ZpcDI3cV